1. SCOPE

The MIT License set out in the file LICENSE applies solely to the source code of
this repository. It does not extend to the Assets. "Assets" means all textures,
images, icons, models, animations, sounds and music contained in or distributed
with this repository or the software built from it, including the screenshots in
.github/assets. This license governs the Assets with effect from the date stated
above.


