3. RESERVATION OF RIGHTS

All Assets other than those listed in Section 2 are the property of their respective authors,
who reserve all rights therein. Except as expressly permitted by this license, no
Asset may be copied, extracted, modified, redistributed or otherwise used without
the prior written permission of its author.


4. PERMITTED USES

Subject to the conditions of this Section, and to the extent that Quiqueck (Team
BetterX) (the "Licensor") holds the necessary rights, permission is hereby granted,
free of charge, to use and redistribute the Assets UNMODIFIED, as part of the
official release files of Team BetterX (the .jar files published by the Licensor on
Modrinth, CurseForge, GitHub Releases or the Licensor's Maven repository at
maven.ambertation.de), provided that the Assets remain bundled therewith:
 (a) in modpacks, server packs and similar bundles; and
 (b) on servers and in services, including commercial and monetized ones.
This permission extends to the Assets listed in Section 2 insofar as the
NonCommercial condition of that license would otherwise preclude such use.
This permission does not extend to the extraction of Assets, to their use on a
stand-alone basis, or to their use in other mods or in forks or other derivative
works of this repository.


5. VIDEOS, STREAMS AND SCREENSHOTS

Subject to the same limitation as to the Licensor's rights, permission is hereby
granted to display, record, stream and capture screenshots of the Assets as they
appear during gameplay, and to publish, distribute and monetize the resulting
works on any platform without further permission. Attribution to the mod is
appreciated but not required. This permission does not extend to the publication
of the Asset files themselves (such as extracted textures, models or audio) or of
soundtracks on a stand-alone basis. Music by third parties remains subject to its
authors' licenses and may be flagged automatically by platforms.


6. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

Music and sounds created by third parties remain the property of their respective
creators and are used under the terms of their own licenses. Nothing in this
license relicenses such material.


